{
  "title": "ISic000088. Fragmentary imperial dedication",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Tuuli Ahlholm</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ara\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ara\">ara</span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"imperatori\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">imp(eratori)</span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesari\"><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Cae[sari]</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">[Augusto]</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">et</span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Liviae\"><span data-text=\"Liviae\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Livia\">Ḷivị[ae]</span></span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"matri\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"mater\">matri</span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Tiberi\"><span data-text=\"Tiberi\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">[Ti(beri)]</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesaris\"><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">[Caes(aris)]</span></span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"imperatoris\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">imp(eratoris)</span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesaris\"><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Cae[s(aris)]</span></span>  <span data-text=\"filii\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"filius\">[filii</span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"ara\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ara\">ara</span>  <span data-text=\"imperatori\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">imperatori</span>  <span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Caesari</span>  <span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">Augusto</span>  <span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">et</span>  <span data-text=\"Liviae\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Livia\">Liviae</span>  <span data-text=\"matri\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"mater\">matri</span>  <span data-text=\"Tiberi\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">Tiberi</span>  <span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Caesaris</span>  <span data-text=\"imperatoris\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">imperatoris</span>  <span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">Caesaris</span>  <span data-text=\"filii\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"filius\">filii</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Tuuli Ahlholm</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"ara\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ara\">ARA</span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"imperatori\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">IMP</span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesari\"><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAE[....</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Augusto\"><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">.......]</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Liviae\"><span data-text=\"Liviae\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Livia\">.IV.[..]</span></span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"matri\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"mater\">MATRI</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Tiberi\"><span data-text=\"Tiberi\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">[...</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesaris\"><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">.....]</span></span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span><span data-text=\"imperatoris\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">IMP</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caesaris\"><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAE[.</span></span><span data-text=\"filii\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"filius\">.....</span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"ara\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ara\">ARA</span><span data-text=\"imperatori\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">IMPERATORI</span><span data-text=\"Caesari\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAESARI</span><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span><span data-text=\"Liviae\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"Livia\">LIVIAE</span><span data-text=\"matri\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"mater\">MATRI</span><span data-text=\"Tiberi\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Tiberius\">TIBERI</span><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAESARIS</span><span data-text=\"imperatoris\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"imperator\">IMPERATORIS</span><span data-text=\"Caesaris\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"Caesar\">CAESARIS</span><span data-text=\"filii\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"filius\">FILII</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text after Gualtherus and Manganaro</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"2\">2: <span>Mommsen: imp(eratori) Cae[sari]</span>  </span><br></li><li><span class=\"3\">3: <span>Gualtherus prints I... at the end of line 3 of frag. 1 and IVL. at the start of the second fragment, united by Mommsen and Manganaro; Manganaro: Liv[iae deae]</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Altar (dedicated) to Imperator Caesar Augustus and Livia mother of Tiberius Caesar son of Imperator Caesar...</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Gualtherus reports the text as being in two fragments, of which the second was already lost. Neither Mommsen nor Manganaro in their proposed restoration and unification of the fragments really make clear how they get from ARA / IMP.CAE.. / ET . I... and IVL. / MATRI. / IMP. CAE. to the restoration of Livia in line 3, although Mommsen's sketch suggests what is proposed here, namely that I... and IVL. need to be understood as a garbled reading of LIVIAE across the break and the transcription of the lost fragment. As Torremuzza observed, it would theoretically be possible instead to refer this e.g. to Caracalla and Iulia Severa.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gualtherus 1624 95 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/310968\" target=\"_blank\">252</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Castelli 1769 cl.4, no.5 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002084\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002084</a>  </li><li> Castelli 1784 cl.4, no.5 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002083</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650795\" target=\"_blank\">7340</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 48, 65 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1989 192 n.128 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001831</a>  </li><li> Bivona 1994 4 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002137</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
